    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve probably seen the news. The entire country is waiting for answers in the Veronika case, the 16 years old girl whose life was taken in such a brutal way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pressure is immense, but I trust that with your expertise, we can get to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/bc5c5e2570cd02f33243115f5659ffba.poster.avif?t=1747845462\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/bc5c5e2570cd02f33243115f5659ffba.webm?t=1747845462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/bc5c5e2570cd02f33243115f5659ffba.mp4?t=1747845462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first chapter, you get <strong>a detective job</strong> by sending  your r\u00e9sum\u00e9, and now, on the first day, you have to deal with the <strong>country\u2019s biggest case.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our police are useless, so we\u2019re calling you from abroad. We\u2019ve prepared <strong>every case file</strong>, every shred of evidence and more importantly a brand new, cutting edge <strong>lie detector device</strong> for you. Examine the evidence, interrogate the suspect and deliver your <strong>verdict</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/5ba514b9f833b61f180d602b92bfe5ac.poster.avif?t=1747845462\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/5ba514b9f833b61f180d602b92bfe5ac.webm?t=1747845462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/5ba514b9f833b61f180d602b92bfe5ac.mp4?t=1747845462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Based on a True Story.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just Drink Your Coffee! It\u2019s All in Your Head!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to air pollution and fatigue, if you do not take coffee, <strong>hallucinations</strong> begin, and you start seeing things everywhere, stemming from your <strong>subconscious</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/e1820725314329c5518a2f1daf0b3160.poster.avif?t=1747845462\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/e1820725314329c5518a2f1daf0b3160.webm?t=1747845462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/e1820725314329c5518a2f1daf0b3160.mp4?t=1747845462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It Gets Worse:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fact checking with <strong>a lie detector device</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juggling <strong>cables</strong> to keep devices running</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search</strong> thorough case files and discover deeper conspiracies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage fatigue induced <strong>hallucinations</strong> through a coffee-making minigame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigating <strong>non-euclidean</strong> spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey \u2026 <strong>DO NOT</strong> get caught by <strong>THAT THING!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your\u00a0<strong>choice</strong> matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic</strong> <strong>realism\u00a0</strong>at its finest</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/4fbcef4a5bf367f0116e836b2439de5f.poster.avif?t=1747845462\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/4fbcef4a5bf367f0116e836b2439de5f.webm?t=1747845462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/4fbcef4a5bf367f0116e836b2439de5f.mp4?t=1747845462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
